Let ComputeShader bind a texture that the shader reads

Backport of https://github.com/pygfx/pygfx/pull/1350
(commit 693d524f68e7ba027bcfc8349df4b96a630116ac), library hunks only.

diff --git a/pygfx/utils/compute.py b/pygfx/utils/compute.py
